    "Scouting Notes": "Disciplined hitter with good bat control. \n Appears to recognize pitches well, showing the ability to square up fastballs and breaking balls.\n Low whiff rate. \n Power is not showing up much so far\n Defensively his pop times are generally around 2.0 seconds and at times are in the low 1.9 second range, fringe average arm\n He gets rid of the ball quickly, helping his mediocre arm strength play up.\n Struggles with receiving velocity and sharp movement. Needs work behind the dish.\n Tough spot for him, needs either the glove or bat to make a leap in order to have a chance at being anything other than a AAAA type at his peak.",
    "Notes Updated 2": "8/5/2022",
